      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found the same issues happen on the strings that include \"Favorites List\", and the phrase is capitalized on the app, compared with Crowdin's that are in lower case. I wrote this issue while in open beta https://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1096428068643536937/1241336700475805787\n\n- 23577 `Rename favorites list`\n\n- 23579 `Clear favorites list`\n\n(see above image)\n\n- 13989 `No one can view this favorites list`\n\n- 14667 `Your friends can view this favorites list`\n\n- 13329 `Anyone can view this favorites list`\n\n- 13269 `Add this world to a favorites list`\n\n- 14125 `Remove this world from a favorites list`\n\n(See the Crowdwin entry for the context image)\n\n... and many more\n\n(edit) another case\n\n- 14555 `View the worlds in this favorites list` (also \"the\" is dropped in the app)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
